# Keep the image to what the server runs: no VCS history, no local state,
# no editor/agent scratch. Tests and docs ride along (they are small and the
# arch tests document the tree), but caches and venvs never do.
.git
.gitignore
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
fly.toml
.claude
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
data
examples
saydo
scripts
*.log
